# PLACEHOLDER — replaced at lane PUBLISH (design/145 D-145.6 condition 3).
#
# This file will hold the PKIX PEM Ed25519 public key that verifies an export's
# MANIFEST.sig: the same key the export page (design/141 §5.5) shows. Its
# private key lives only in Doppler as GLENR_EXIT_RELEASE_SIGNING_KEY's export
# counterpart, never in this repository. PUBLISH writes the key byte for byte
# from the deployed register key and posts its fingerprint, never the private
# key.
#
# Until PUBLISH fills it, bin/verify.sh fails here on purpose rather than
# accepting anything: this is not a PEM block, so OpenSSL refuses it.
